member.summary:
Heatmap: day heatmap uses seller | shop;
hourly heatmap uses total | seller.
When set, only that dimension is computed (faster). Null/empty = both (legacy).

Snapshot of the pricing formula last applied on a listing (batch sale-price calculator).
Local-only — not pushed to 4Seller. Preview discount/profit on the edit UI is reference-only;
business sales/profit use listing SalePrice / order costs, not this snapshot.

Mọi lần mua NCC đã gắn vào đơn sàn này (1 TikTok → N billno SHEIN). Các trường
Supplier* cấp đơn lấy từ Orders.Charged* (materialize lúc sync);
TotalCost = gross NCC + BuyTrack + ThankCard; Profit = Revenue − TotalCost.

Giá trị hiện tại khi nhiệm vụ có định lượng:
sync_extension = số bước sync xong; listing_fill = published;
delist_cleanup = delistCount từ summary sau sync analytics.

Missing  that we still intend to write is re-inserted;
missing  / other types are detached so a duplicate-merge
delete is not undone. Existing rows keep current values and refresh originals.

Builds TikTok category_infos for the extension scrape.
Seller Center treats one category_infos array as a single filter;
multiple shop catalog picks must be separate groups (OR), not concatenated.

One group per catalog category: the selected node only
(level = TikTokCategory.Level + 1). Duplicate ids collapsed;
ids missing from  skipped.

Money side of the SHEIN payload reader. Ported from the extension's sheinOrders.ts;
the field precedence encodes which SHEIN keys were found trustworthy on real orders, so it
must stay in step with the TypeScript or the two paths will disagree on cost.
